ach and the escape from a café to the rocks. Their context is the Riviera near the fictional Hotel Mirana, without a precise beach.","source":{"url":"https://online.fliphtml5.com/unwsfj/Lolita---Vladimir-Nabokov/#p=8","label":"Vladimir Nabokov · Lolita · 1.3"},"evidenceReview":"03296f7fad4be3ee2f3719e32031f9843b61e178244623e8362c7cbeda4aba1e"},"5":{"category":"action","scene":"Humbert recalls the interrupted meeting with Annabel behind her family’s villa. The Riviera is established by the preceding chapters, not a real address for the villa.","source":{"url":"https://online.fliphtml5.com/unwsfj/Lolita---Vladimir-Nabokov/#p=9","label":"Vladimir Nabokov · Lolita · 1.4"},"evidenceReview":"711bab7b4e3d57b779db7f13aaf8ac3cdf6a1e0e687fbe79976ea3a6215d1ab2"}}}]'::jsonb) where b.id='lolita' and not exists(select 1 from jsonb_array_elements(b.metadata->'geographicReview'->'regionalPlaces') r where r->>'id'='regional-riviera');
