('lolita','en','d2186c04b2ccd400eb2ea0a99b04ca301e7f19d5e11f4334ae23a7f502365086','The expedition and the boulder scene belong to Arctic Canada. The camp is not located. Prince of Wales Island is a conjecture about the expedition’s purpose, and Victoria Island is expressly excluded as that purpose.','The expedition and the boulder scene belong to Arctic Canada. The camp is not located. Prince of Wales Island is a conjecture about the expedition’s purpose, and Victoria Island is expressly excluded as that purpose.'),
('lolita','it','d2186c04b2ccd400eb2ea0a99b04ca301e7f19d5e11f4334ae23a7f502365086','The expedition and the boulder scene belong to Arctic Canada. The camp is not located. Prince of Wales Island is a conjecture about the expedition’s purpose, and Victoria Island is expressly excluded as that purpose.','La spedizione e la scena del masso appartengono all’Artico canadese. Il campo non è localizzato. Prince of Wales Island è una congettura sullo scopo della spedizione; Victoria Island è espressamente esclusa come scopo.'),
('lolita','fr','d2186c04b2ccd400eb2ea0a99b04ca301e7f19d5e11f4334ae23a7f502365086','The expedition and the boulder scene belong to Arctic Canada. The camp is not located. Prince of Wales Island is a conjecture about the expedition’s purpose, and Victoria Island is expressly excluded as that purpose.','L’expédition et la scène du rocher se situent dans l’Arctique canadien. Le camp n’est pas localisé. Prince of Wales Island est une conjecture sur le but de l’expédition ; Victoria Island est explicitement exclue comme but.'),
('lolita','es','d2186c04b2ccd400eb2ea0a99b04ca301e7f19d5e11f4334ae23a7f502365086','The expedition and the boulder scene belong to Arctic Canada. The camp is not located. Prince of Wales Island is a conjecture about the expedition’s purpose, and Victoria Island is expressly excluded as that purpose.','La expedición y la escena de la roca se sitúan en el Ártico canadiense. El campamento no está localizado. Prince of Wales Island es una conjetura sobre el objetivo; Victoria Island se excluye expresamente como objetivo.'),
