('lolita','es','8afe8cbfaa85ba2ea765ee468351b064abb1342926daf3bc9e1bf7b56f61c36d','Arctic Canada · expedition region','Ártico canadiense · región de la expedición'),
('lolita','en','6b9408a637d3e427027bc792c528102307f6230c4c5711695657037e1c388d26','Part II, chapter 30 explicitly places the night stop somewhere in Appalachia. The diamond represents the broad region, not the anonymous town, a particular state or the disguised roads.','Part II, chapter 30 explicitly places the night stop somewhere in Appalachia. The diamond represents the broad region, not the anonymous town, a particular state or the disguised roads.'),
('lolita','it','6b9408a637d3e427027bc792c528102307f6230c4c5711695657037e1c388d26','Part II, chapter 30 explicitly places the night stop somewhere in Appalachia. The diamond represents the broad region, not the anonymous town, a particular state or the disguised roads.','La parte II, capitolo 30, colloca esplicitamente la sosta notturna da qualche parte negli Appalachi. Il rombo rappresenta la regione ampia, non la cittadina anonima, uno Stato preciso o le strade camuffate.'),
('lolita','fr','6b9408a637d3e427027bc792c528102307f6230c4c5711695657037e1c388d26','Part II, chapter 30 explicitly places the night stop somewhere in Appalachia. The diamond represents the broad region, not the anonymous town, a particular state or the disguised roads.','La deuxième partie, chapitre 30, situe explicitement l’arrêt nocturne quelque part dans les Appalaches. Le losange représente la vaste région, pas la ville anonyme, un État précis ni les routes camouflées.'),
('lolita','es','6b9408a637d3e427027bc792c528102307f6230c4c5711695657037e1c388d26','Part II, chapter 30 explicitly places the night stop somewhere in Appalachia. The diamond represents the broad region, not the anonymous town, a particular state or the disguised roads.','La segunda parte, capítulo 30, sitúa expresamente la parada nocturna en algún lugar de los Apalaches. El rombo representa la región amplia, no la localidad anónima, un estado preciso ni las carreteras camufladas.'),
