('lolita','fr','8f590da1c3f82947bddc2d9a8fcf9c942d1f7d40c6a9ff84e78b0106735fac8f','Appalachia · unnamed town','Appalaches · ville anonyme'),
('lolita','es','8f590da1c3f82947bddc2d9a8fcf9c942d1f7d40c6a9ff84e78b0106735fac8f','Appalachia · unnamed town','Apalaches · localidad anónima'),
('lolita','en','e218b2eef1daea721c6b0e8c6ce522f0f3f27ea302ac28d0165c8039c92fd656','Zimmer identifies the garden in Part II, chapter 2 as Magnolia Gardens near Charleston. The official site confirms the Ashley River grounds at 3550 Ashley River Road. The point locates the property, not Dolores’s bench.','Zimmer identifies the garden in Part II, chapter 2 as Magnolia Gardens near Charleston. The official site confirms the Ashley River grounds at 3550 Ashley River Road. The point locates the property, not Dolores’s bench.'),
('lolita','it','e218b2eef1daea721c6b0e8c6ce522f0f3f27ea302ac28d0165c8039c92fd656','Zimmer identifies the garden in Part II, chapter 2 as Magnolia Gardens near Charleston. The official site confirms the Ashley River grounds at 3550 Ashley River Road. The point locates the property, not Dolores’s bench.','Zimmer identifica il giardino della parte II, capitolo 2, con Magnolia Gardens presso Charleston. Il sito ufficiale conferma il complesso sull’Ashley River al 3550 Ashley River Road. Il punto localizza la proprietà, non la panchina di Dolores.'),
('lolita','fr','e218b2eef1daea721c6b0e8c6ce522f0f3f27ea302ac28d0165c8039c92fd656','Zimmer identifies the garden in Part II, chapter 2 as Magnolia Gardens near Charleston. The official site confirms the Ashley River grounds at 3550 Ashley River Road. The point locates the property, not Dolores’s bench.','Zimmer identifie le jardin de la deuxième partie, chapitre 2, à Magnolia Gardens près de Charleston. Le site officiel confirme le domaine sur l’Ashley River au 3550 Ashley River Road. Le point situe la propriété, pas le banc de Dolores.'),
('lolita','es','e218b2eef1daea721c6b0e8c6ce522f0f3f27ea302ac28d0165c8039c92fd656','Zimmer identifies the garden in Part II, chapter 2 as Magnolia Gardens near Charleston. The official site confirms the Ashley River grounds at 3550 Ashley River Road. The point locates the property, not Dolores’s bench.','Zimmer identifica el jardín de la segunda parte, capítulo 2, con Magnolia Gardens cerca de Charleston. El sitio oficial confirma el recinto del Ashley River en 3550 Ashley River Road. El punto sitúa la propiedad, no el banco de Dolores.'),
('lolita','en','4a14648a092725a11e40ae25684dae56d9b75416ab1d78caae53bc77a708e277','Humbert recalls a conversation in his school garden near the Hotel Mirana. The setting is the Riviera; neither the school nor the fictional hotel is identified.','Humbert recalls a conversation in his school garden near the Hotel Mirana. The setting is the Riviera; neither the school nor the fictional hotel is identified.'),
