('lolita','en','7c6dcf19b0d53cf06542fab939c3a26abd4953b8eae45e2de2f7aae90e97b4ba','The memories of Annabel include the beach and the escape from a café to the rocks. Their context is the Riviera near the fictional Hotel Mirana, without a precise beach.','The memories of Annabel include the beach and the escape from a café to the rocks. Their context is the Riviera near the fictional Hotel Mirana, without a precise beach.'),
('lolita','it','7c6dcf19b0d53cf06542fab939c3a26abd4953b8eae45e2de2f7aae90e97b4ba','The memories of Annabel include the beach and the escape from a café to the rocks. Their context is the Riviera near the fictional Hotel Mirana, without a precise beach.','I ricordi di Annabel comprendono la spiaggia e la fuga dal caffè verso gli scogli. Il contesto è la Riviera presso l’Hotel Mirana immaginario, senza una spiaggia identificata.'),
('lolita','fr','7c6dcf19b0d53cf06542fab939c3a26abd4953b8eae45e2de2f7aae90e97b4ba','The memories of Annabel include the beach and the escape from a café to the rocks. Their context is the Riviera near the fictional Hotel Mirana, without a precise beach.','Les souvenirs d’Annabel comprennent la plage et la fuite du café vers les rochers. Leur cadre est la Riviera près de l’hôtel Mirana fictif, sans plage identifiée.'),
('lolita','es','7c6dcf19b0d53cf06542fab939c3a26abd4953b8eae45e2de2f7aae90e97b4ba','The memories of Annabel include the beach and the escape from a café to the rocks. Their context is the Riviera near the fictional Hotel Mirana, without a precise beach.','Los recuerdos de Annabel incluyen la playa y la huida del café hacia las rocas. El contexto es la Riviera junto al Hotel Mirana ficticio, sin una playa identificada.'),
('lolita','en','9c7514b975d4baf7eba6b01de2b3820becd4f7eba4a8f4810ef3c7ae636454c0','Humbert recalls the interrupted meeting with Annabel behind her family’s villa. The Riviera is established by the preceding chapters, not a real address for the villa.','Humbert recalls the interrupted meeting with Annabel behind her family’s villa. The Riviera is established by the preceding chapters, not a real address for the villa.'),
