('lolita','fr','9c7514b975d4baf7eba6b01de2b3820becd4f7eba4a8f4810ef3c7ae636454c0','Humbert recalls the interrupted meeting with Annabel behind her family’s villa. The Riviera is established by the preceding chapters, not a real address for the villa.','Humbert se rappelle la rencontre interrompue avec Annabel derrière la villa familiale. La Riviera est établie par les chapitres précédents, sans adresse réelle pour la villa.'),
('lolita','es','9c7514b975d4baf7eba6b01de2b3820becd4f7eba4a8f4810ef3c7ae636454c0','Humbert recalls the interrupted meeting with Annabel behind her family’s villa. The Riviera is established by the preceding chapters, not a real address for the villa.','Humbert recuerda el encuentro interrumpido con Annabel detrás de la villa familiar. La Riviera queda establecida en los capítulos anteriores, sin una dirección real para la villa.'),
('lolita','en','ecadcebb8e3e4665d928ff9d117e0c6bcbe17728a5ffedf75b1255fe2b5c831d','In Paris, Valeria reveals her affair. Humbert questions her in a taxi and then meets her lover at a café; the text gives no address for these scenes.','In Paris, Valeria reveals her affair. Humbert questions her in a taxi and then meets her lover at a café; the text gives no address for these scenes.'),
('lolita','it','ecadcebb8e3e4665d928ff9d117e0c6bcbe17728a5ffedf75b1255fe2b5c831d','In Paris, Valeria reveals her affair. Humbert questions her in a taxi and then meets her lover at a café; the text gives no address for these scenes.','A Parigi Valeria rivela la relazione. Humbert la interroga in taxi e poi incontra l’amante al caffè; il testo non dà un indirizzo per queste scene.'),
