('lolita','es','ecadcebb8e3e4665d928ff9d117e0c6bcbe17728a5ffedf75b1255fe2b5c831d','In Paris, Valeria reveals her affair. Humbert questions her in a taxi and then meets her lover at a café; the text gives no address for these scenes.','En París, Valeria revela su relación. Humbert la interroga en un taxi y después conoce a su amante en un café; el texto no da una dirección para estas escenas.'),
('lolita','en','4e6d502d803ddf6a6e7af82a03e473dc931d6d782d75752f586cfab35179877c','A doctor’s embedded account describes Valeria and Maximovich during an experiment in California. This is the reported scene’s setting, not a visit by Humbert or an identified laboratory.','A doctor’s embedded account describes Valeria and Maximovich during an experiment in California. This is the reported scene’s setting, not a visit by Humbert or an identified laboratory.'),
