('lolita','en','df6b80bd65be881f9687285704d8cd35dd9dc24749195fb10d29cf5c66b019a7','In Coalmont, Humbert uses a telephone booth, asks for directions and reaches the Schillers’ house. The narrator explicitly camouflages the town; the broad Midwest position identifies no real Coalmont.','In Coalmont, Humbert uses a telephone booth, asks for directions and reaches the Schillers’ house. The narrator explicitly camouflages the town; the broad Midwest position identifies no real Coalmont.'),
